Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:22.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,《星际迷航: 新世界》前情提要\N{\rENG}Previously on Star Trek: Strange New Worlds...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克 这是詹姆斯·柯克\N{\rENG}Spock, meet James Kirk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:25.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,法拉格特号的大副\N{\rENG}first officer of the Farragut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:26.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,当年我刚接受任命时\N{\rENG}When I took my commission,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟着派克学习了一周\N{\rENG}I spent a week shadowing Pike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:29.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,那段经历让我受益匪浅\N{\rENG}It made all the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:30.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道几乎永生\N{\rENG}You want to know the worst thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:33.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,这件事最糟糕的一点是什么吗\N{\rENG}about living almost forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会失去你爱的人\N{\rENG}The loss of those you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错 克里斯\N{\rENG}It wasn't your fault, Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:37.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是领队人\N{\rENG}I led the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得对别人的生命负责\N{\rENG}We're responsible for other people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:41.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,船员们的性命就是我的一切\N{\rENG}The lives of my crew mean everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:44.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的职业让我们不得不频繁的面对死亡\N{\rENG}Our job puts us up against death
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这本就不公平\N{\rENG}more than is fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.55,0:00:47.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以选择让死亡赢过你\N{\rENG}Now, you can let death win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:50.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,又或是挺身反击它\N{\rENG}or you can fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:01:00.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,大副私人日志 星历\N{\rENG}First officer's personal log. Stardate...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:02.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,星历到底是怎么算的\N{\rENG}What is the stardate?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:05.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,日子全都混淆在一起了\N{\rENG}They're all blending together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:07.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,法拉格特号正在联邦星域外\N{\rENG}Farragut is conducting a planetary survey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.70,0:01:10.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,对一颗无人居住的M级星球 赫利孔γ星\N{\rENG}of Helicon Gamma, an uninhabited M-class world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:12.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,进行行星勘测\N{\rENG}outside Federation space, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:19.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我实在是无聊极了\N{\rENG}...I am so deeply bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:22.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发现最近总是忍不住质疑\N{\rENG}I find myself constantly questioning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:24.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,维瑞尔舰长的命令\N{\rENG}Captain V'Rel's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:27.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,对于风险 她避之唯恐不及\N{\rENG}It's like she's allergic to risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.02,0:01:29.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在宇宙里是要干实事的\N{\rENG}We're out here to get our hands dirty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:31.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是来探索的\N{\rENG}to be explorers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:33.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,而不是对着扫描数据三重核查 纸上谈兵\N{\rENG}not to triple-check every sensor reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:35.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\rENG}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,她想严格按照规定来办事\N{\rENG}She wants to do everything by the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,昨天晚上到现在有什么变化吗\N{\rENG}Any changes since last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:41.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得如果规定是我定的\N{\rENG}I just think the book would be more interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:43.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,事情会变得更有趣一些\N{\rENG}if I got to write it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:44.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,舵手\N{\rENG}Helm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,带我们去北部大陆上空的\N{\rENG}bring us into a low geosynchronous orbit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:47.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,近地同步轨道\N{\rENG}over the northern continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:51.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,维瑞尔舰长\N{\rENG}Captain V'Rel, if I may,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:54.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们能再靠近一点的话\N{\rENG}we could get much more detailed readings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:56.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,就能得到更多更具体的数据了\N{\rENG}from an even lower orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:57.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的是多近\N{\rENG}How low do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:58.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近的那种\N{\rENG}Lowest orbit there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:00.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲自踏上星球的土地\N{\rENG}Our boots on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:02.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,考虑到地质不稳定的因素\N{\rENG}Given the geological instability,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:04.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样做会带来不必要的风险\N{\rENG}it seems an unwarranted risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:06.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来就是为了风险的 不是吗\N{\rENG}Risk is why we're here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:08.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不然星际舰队只要发一颗探测器过来就好了\N{\rENG}Starfleet could have sent a probe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:10.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是他们让我们来了\N{\rENG}but instead they sent us
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:12.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为有些事必须要我们亲眼所见\N{\rENG}because some things you need to see for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:14.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,-才能真正理解 -舰长\N{\rENG}- to truly understand. - Captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:15.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚刚有一股未知的力量撞到了\N{\rENG}an unknown force just impacted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:17.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,赫利孔γ星的地表\N{\rENG}Helicon Gamma's surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:18.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,报告\N{\rENG}Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:20.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,检测到行星地壳发生地震波扰动\N{\rENG}There's a seismic disturbance in the planet's crust.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:26.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,红色警报\N{\rENG}Red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,舵手 规避机动\N{\rENG}Helm, take evasive action.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:30.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,全体船员 做好冲击准备\N{\rENG}All hands, brace for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:08.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,医疗团队马上到舰桥\N{\rENG}Medical team to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:13.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是联邦星舰法拉格特号\N{\rENG}This is the USS Farragut.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:16.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要紧急援助 我们遭受严重损伤\N{\rENG}We need immediate assistance. We've taken heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:18.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官 有什么东西在干扰我们的通讯信号\N{\rENG}Sir, something's interfering with the comms signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正在尝试识别其来源\N{\rENG}I'm trying to identify the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:31.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,是那玩意发出的干扰\N{\rENG}It's coming from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.54,0:05:39.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,读数怎样\N{\rENG}Readings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:42.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有生命信号\N{\rENG}Life signs on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们的人手只够操作星舰的\N{\rENG}but barely enough to crew the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:45.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么多系统宕机\N{\rENG}Multiple systems nonfunctioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:48.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,看在贝尔德的份上到底怎么回事\N{\rENG}What in Baird's name happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:49.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,看在谁份上?\N{\rENG}Whose name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:50.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个苏格兰籍的发明家\N{\rENG}The Scottish inventor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,无人不知约翰·罗杰·贝尔德啊\N{\rENG}Everyone knows John Logie Baird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:00.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,救援来了吗\N{\rENG}Rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:01.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的确是来救援的\N{\rENG}That is our purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:03.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,问题是 谁袭击了你们\N{\rENG}The question is: rescue from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:06.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只看见了一眼 特别大的东西\N{\rENG}I only saw a glimpse. It was huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:08.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,他正在内出血\N{\rENG}He's got internal bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要把他带到医务室去\N{\rENG}I need to get him to sickbay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我最好赶紧去轮机室\N{\rENG}I'd better go to Engineering
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:11.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,去看看曲速核心怎么样了\N{\rENG}and check there's still a warp core.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:13.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后来汇报你们的发现\N{\rENG}Report back with your findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:14.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会在舰桥\N{\rENG}We will offer our assistance
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:15.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮助维瑞尔舰长\N{\rENG}to Captain V'Rel on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:17.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\rENG}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:18.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,不光是舰对舰通讯\N{\rENG}It's not just ship to ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:20.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的通讯都不能用了\N{\rENG}All comms are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:21.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没法和彼此保持联系\N{\rENG}We'll have no way to get in touch with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:22.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,去吧 \N{\rENG}Go. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:24.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,但到时候在尽快在舰桥汇合\N{\rENG}But find your way to the bridge as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:30.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你给我好好撑住\N{\rENG}Don't you shut down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.02,0:06:32.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,增援到了\N{\rENG}Reinforcements have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:36.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的首席医疗官呢 少尉\N{\rENG}Where's your CMO, Ensign?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:41.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 只剩你了\N{\rENG}Just you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:44.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,身上好多都是钝器伤\N{\rENG}I'm seeing a lot of blunt-force injuries in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.91,0:06:45.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\rENG}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该去问舰长\N{\rENG}You should ask the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:48.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,她在四号床\N{\rENG}Bed four.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:53.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,维瑞尔舰长 我是查普尔护士\N{\rENG}Captain V'Rel, I'm Nurse Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:58.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有些脑挫伤 但没有颅脑肿胀\N{\rENG}You have a cerebral contusion. There's no cranial swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:06:59.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要回舰桥去\N{\rENG}I need to get back to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.55,0:07:01.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 等我们确定了\N{\rENG}Mm-hmm, right after we make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:03.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没有脑疝的症状之后再说\N{\rENG}that your brain isn't herniating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:04.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,躺下\N{\rENG}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.12,0:07:07.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的外勤队已经去舰桥了\N{\rENG}Our away team is heading to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:08.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会帮忙的\N{\rENG}They can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:13.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,试试绕过主传感器系统\N{\rENG}Try bypassing primary sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:15.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,检查侧向阵列还有没有未损坏的功能模块\N{\rENG}See if anything's functioning in the lateral array.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿尔瓦雷斯 带我们离开这片残骸区\N{\rENG}Alvarez, get us out of this debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:21.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官 没有传感器的话太危险了\N{\rENG}Sir, it's too dangerous without the sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:23.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,-舰长 -维瑞尔舰长把指挥权交给了我\N{\rENG}- Captain... - Captain V'Rel left me the conn,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的职责是确保船的安全\N{\rENG}and it's up to me to return it intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:28.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克先生\N{\rENG}Mr. Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌乎拉少尉 拉安\N{\rENG}Ensign Uhura. La'An.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:31.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎登舰\N{\rENG}Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:32.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\rENG}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这边的乱子真是有够大的\N{\rENG}Quite a mess you've gotten yourself into.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:35.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来这是我的专长\N{\rENG}Seems to be my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:37.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们能接到求救信号真是奇迹\N{\rENG}It's a miracle you got our distress call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:38.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,通讯都被干扰了\N{\rENG}Signal was jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,信号干扰也对我们造成了严重的影响\N{\rENG}The interference has wreaked havoc with us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:42.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我也许能建立一条视讯连接\N{\rENG}But I might be able to set up line of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,请求借用你们的遥测仪器\N{\rENG}Permission to borrow your telemetry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:44.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全可以\N{\rENG}More than granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:49.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿尔瓦雷斯 让我们靠近进取号\N{\rENG}Alvarez, aim us at the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备联系舰长\N{\rENG}Stand by for the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:00.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克舰长\N{\rENG}Captain Pike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.61,0:08:02.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,鉴于目前情况十分危急\N{\rENG}I'll dispense with the pleasantries
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:03.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就不多说客套话了\N{\rENG}since we're still in a critical situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:05.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,威胁目标还在当前区域吗\N{\rENG}Is the threat still in the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:06.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不清楚\N{\rENG}Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:07.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我你知道的信息\N{\rENG}Tell me what you do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:10.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们当时正在对赫利孔γ星进行地质勘测\N{\rENG}We were in the middle of a geological survey of Helicon Gamma 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:12.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在这时\N{\rENG}when--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,坦白说 实在无法用科学术语来描述当时的状况\N{\rENG}well, there's no scientific way to put it--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球瞬间天崩地裂\N{\rENG}all hell broke loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,-因为星球不稳定吗 -不是\N{\rENG}- Planetary instability? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:20.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,一束聚焦的引力束瞄准了这颗行星\N{\rENG}A focused gravitational beam aimed at the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:22.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,被什么瞄准的\N{\rENG}Aimed by what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:24.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,拥有发射功率如此强大的牵引光束\N{\rENG}A ship capable of generating a tractor beam that 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:25.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这飞船的规模恐怕\N{\rENG}powerful would have to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,比有记录以来的任何星舰\N{\rENG}Several orders of magnitude bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,都要大上好几个数量级\N{\rENG}than any starship on record.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:31.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很荒谬 但这是真的\N{\rENG}I know. It sounds crazy, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:34.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们差点都没发现它 它对我们不感兴趣\N{\rENG}We barely saw it. It wasn't interested in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:35.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不过是它的连带损伤\N{\rENG}We were just collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:37.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,灭世者\N{\rENG}Destroyer of Worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:38.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后它就消失了吗\N{\rENG}And it just disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们撞上碎片的时候 传感器\N{\rENG}When the debris hit, we lost sensors,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:42.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,通讯 所有重要系统都损坏了\N{\rENG}comms, all critical systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:44.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,维瑞尔舰长虽已受伤 但意识尚清\N{\rENG}Captain V'Rel was injured but lucid enough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:45.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,足以下达撤离指令\N{\rENG}to give the evacuation order.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,逃生舱已部署完毕\N{\rENG}Escape pods have been deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会留下最低限度的留守人员\N{\rENG}I'm keeping a skeleton crew aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:50.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽量避免法拉格特号沦为需要打捞的废船\N{\rENG}so Farragut doesn't become a salvage job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你做得很好\N{\rENG}Well, you've performed commendably,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:55.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,但还是把你们都一并救出来吧\N{\rENG}but let's get you all to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:56.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,一号 让法拉格特号的全体成员\N{\rENG}Number One, I want all Farragut crew
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:57.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,立刻传送到舰上来\N{\rENG}beamed aboard immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:58.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白 舰长\N{\rENG}Aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:08:59.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,全员撤退 从逃生舱开始\N{\rENG}Full evacuation. We'll start with the escape pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:01.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,执行吧\N{\rENG}Proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:01.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,派克舰长\N{\rENG}Captain Pike...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我明白 我也不会放弃我的星舰\N{\rENG}I know, I wouldn't want to give up my ship either,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,但舰员的安全必须放在首位\N{\rENG}but the safety of the crew has to come first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是正确的决定\N{\rENG}It's the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:09.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有严重受伤的患者在医务室\N{\rENG}We have some critically injured patients in sickbay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,缺少医生照顾\N{\rENG}and no doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:10.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌乎拉少尉\N{\rENG}Ensign Uhura,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:12.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟查普尔确认哪些患者需要紧急撤离\N{\rENG}confirm with Chapel which patients require immediate evac 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:13.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后把他们送往进取号\N{\rENG}and get them to Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:14.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上去办 舰长\N{\rENG}On it, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,在你撤离之前\N{\rENG}Before you evacuate,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.59,0:09:17.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,把该未知星舰的所有战术信息传输给进取号\N{\rENG}transfer all tactical info on this mystery ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:19.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,以防他们再次出手 我要做好充足的准备\N{\rENG}I want to be ready if they take another swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经恢复了部分传感器的功能\N{\rENG}I have restored some function to sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:22.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们仅有的这点数据就交给\N{\rENG}Sending what little data we have back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:23.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,努尼恩·辛格上尉带回\N{\rENG}with Lieutenant Noonien-Singh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:24.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在就传送回舰 舰长\N{\rENG}Beaming back now, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来亲自把这个交给你\N{\rENG}I'll hand this to you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:27.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,开始传送\N{\rENG}Energize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:31.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在 把你们全部的系统\N{\rENG}Now put all your systems...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:32.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌乎拉 重新接通\N{\rENG}Uhura, get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:33.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生什么了\N{\rENG}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,恐怕连不上了\N{\rENG}I don't think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:39.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rENG}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿尔瓦雷斯 我需要你负责战术岗位\N{\rENG}Alvarez, I need you on tactical.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:49.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好所有武器\N{\rENG}Prepare all weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白 长官\N{\rENG}Aye, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,进取号在视野内 他们正在交战\N{\rENG}We have visual on Enterprise. They are engaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:03.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,用上所有的武器朝对方开火\N{\rENG}Whatever we've got, fire at that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:04.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不合逻辑\N{\rENG}That is illogical.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,进取号的武器明显起不到任何作用\N{\rENG}Enterprise's weapons were clearly ineffective.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:07.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的瞄准系统下线了\N{\rENG}Our targeting systems are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:09.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在开火的话作用极微\N{\rENG}Firing would serve little purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:10.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,-并且还有可能会误伤进取号 -那我们总得做点什么吧\N{\rENG}- and risk damaging Enterprise. - Well, we have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们总得做点什么吧\N{\rENG}- and risk damaging Enterprise. - Well, we have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:12.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能坐着干等着\N{\rENG}We can't just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:20.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,此刻\N{\rENG}At present,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,恐怕我们只能这么做\N{\rENG}I am afraid that is all we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.77,0:10:39.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,诊断 我现在就要完整的舰船诊断报告\N{\rENG}Diagnostic. I want a complete ship diagnostic right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:42.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有一些好消息\N{\rENG}Uh, well, here's some good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:43.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不再受到干扰了\N{\rENG}We're not being jammed anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:44.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:46.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰桥呼叫医务室 \N{\rENG}Bridge to sickbay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:48.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要尽快和维瑞尔舰长通话\N{\rENG}I need to speak to Captain V'Rel ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:49.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔护士回报\N{\rENG}Nurse Chapel reporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,她需要进行紧急颅骨切除术\N{\rENG}She required an emergency craniectomy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:52.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我没有能力实施这个手术\N{\rENG}which I'm not qualified to perform,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:54.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,于是两分钟前\N{\rENG}so I beamed her to the Enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:55.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已将她传送至进取号\N{\rENG}two minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:01.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,指挥官 你现在是法拉格特号的舰长了\N{\rENG}Commander, you are now captain of the Farragut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:03.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们静候您的命令 长官\N{\rENG}We await your orders, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.73,0:11:27.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么你能辨别出来的吗\N{\rENG}Anything you recognize?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.99,0:11:29.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能是克林贡的 难说\N{\rENG}Klingon maybe. Hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:31.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里没剩下多少东西能去辨别了\N{\rENG}There's not much left to recognize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:33.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,有些看起来年头还不小\N{\rENG}Some of them seem ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:35.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,损伤报告如何\N{\rENG}Damage report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:37.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,主动力离线 所有网络系统都失效了\N{\rENG}Main power's off-line, all network systems are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:39.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,引擎 武器 内部通讯系统\N{\rENG}Engines, weapons, internal comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,便携式通讯器还是不能用\N{\rENG}Hand communicators still are not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:42.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,太多干扰了\N{\rENG}Too much interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:43.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,维生系统呢\N{\rENG}Life support?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:44.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,在以最低限度工作\N{\rENG}Working but minimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:45.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,派一名通讯员去\N{\rENG}Send a runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.57,0:11:47.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,口头通知舰员到星舰中部空间集中\N{\rENG}Tell the crew to gather in central spaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:49.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰体外壳附近的区域会冷死人的\N{\rENG}Areas near the outer hull are gonna get pretty damn cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.51,0:11:52.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长 我们派遣到轮机部的通讯员一直没回来\N{\rENG}Captain, the last runner we sent to Engineering hasn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:54.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,那只能假设我们已经被登舰了\N{\rENG}Then we have to assume that we've been boarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:56.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,法拉格特号的传感器日志有什么信息\N{\rENG}Did the Farragut's sensor logs tell us anything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:58.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,能看出建造这艘船的种族吗\N{\rENG}about the species that built this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:00.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的船体对于我们的传感器来说几乎不可穿透\N{\rENG}Their hull is nearly impenetrable to our sensors,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,但看得出来他们的科技极为先进\N{\rENG}but it's clear they're incredibly advanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:03.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长 你听说过阿萨斯里克吗\N{\rENG}Sir, have you heard of Asaasllich,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:05.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,灭世者\N{\rENG}Destroyer of Worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:08.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,它还有一个译法是噬星者\N{\rENG}It-it also translates as Astrovore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:09.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,噬星者吗 没听过\N{\rENG}Astrovore? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:11.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个在偏僻的殖民地长大的孩子\N{\rENG}Well, every child growing up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:12.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,都听说过它\N{\rENG}on a remote colony world has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不同的名字 但本质上是一个东西\N{\rENG}Different names, same story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:18.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,一艘有数百年历史的拾荒船\N{\rENG}Scavenger ship, hundreds of years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,在已知星域的边缘之外游弋\N{\rENG}prowling just beyond the edges of known space.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:22.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,从各种行星以及\N{\rENG}Consuming resources from planets
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:23.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有不幸与其相遇的舰船身上掠夺资源\N{\rENG}and any ship unlucky enough to cross its path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:25.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在边境附近任职时也听过一个说法\N{\rENG}I heard a version when I was posted near the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:29.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,克林贡人称其为查克-卡 意为湮灭者\N{\rENG}Klingons called it Chach-Ka. "The Annihilator."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,索耶上将也在他的星际制图课上\N{\rENG}Admiral Sawyer told a story like that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:32.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,讲过类似的故事\N{\rENG}in his Stellar Cartography class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:34.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,地图边缘之外的怪物\N{\rENG}The monster past the edge of the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:36.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论是不是那艘传说中的飞船\N{\rENG}Whether or not this is that ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:37.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经确定它是一艘拾荒船\N{\rENG}we know it's a scavenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须假设他们\N{\rENG}We have to assume that their intention
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:40.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,也打算把进取号给撕碎\N{\rENG}is to tear the Enterprise apart as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:42.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,一号 我需要你和奥特加斯合作\N{\rENG}Number One, I need you and Ortegas to find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:44.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到重新让引擎上线的方法\N{\rENG}to get engine control back online
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样只要我们赶去轮机室\N{\rENG}so that when we get to Engineering
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:46.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦阻止能量流失\N{\rENG}and we stop the power drain,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:48.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就能逃跑了\N{\rENG}we're ready to make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,代理舰长日志\N{\rENG}Acting captain's log.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:58.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个称谓读着很奇怪\N{\rENG}Feels strange to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:13:01.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不是事态这么糟糕 我应该会很兴奋吧\N{\rENG}Under better circumstances, it would be thrilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:04.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经让进取号的军官们\N{\rENG}I've asked the Enterprise officers to fill in
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,去各自填补舰桥上的岗位空缺\N{\rENG}for our missing bridge crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:08.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他们几乎不了解我\N{\rENG}But they barely know me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,而现在我却要他们完全信任我\N{\rENG}and now I have to ask them to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:13.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我是他们的话\N{\rENG}If I were in their shoes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:16.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,暂停记录 请进\N{\rENG}Pause recording. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:20.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,柯克舰长 我们整理了所有\N{\rENG}Captain Kirk, we compiled all of the data
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:21.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,与外星飞船遭遇时获取的数据\N{\rENG}from our encounter with the alien vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:22.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都知道些什么\N{\rENG}What do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:25.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的传感器无法彻底穿透其船壳\N{\rENG}Our sensors cannot fully penetrate its hull,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:27.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,因此 关于飞船的构成\N{\rENG}so we can ascertain little of its composition,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:28.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,性能或船员配置 我们基本都无法确定\N{\rENG}capabilities or crew complement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:29.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,它的弱点呢\N{\rENG}What about weaknesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,根据基础数学知识 按照它的尺寸\N{\rENG}Fundamental math? Its size.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,对于这么大的家伙来说\N{\rENG}It would be hard to generate a stable warp field
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,要维持稳定的曲速场是很难的 对吗\N{\rENG}at that scale, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:36.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么说 它应该会很慢\N{\rENG}Well, odds are, it's slow, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:38.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们就能抓到它\N{\rENG}But then we can catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:39.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,按照规定\N{\rENG}Regulations...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:41.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,按照规定 我们本该夹着尾巴\N{\rENG}Regulations would have us tuck tail
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,逃回联邦星域\N{\rENG}and run back to Federation space.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:44.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我们连上子空间通讯中继\N{\rENG}By the time we reach a subspace relay
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:45.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,搬到援兵的时候\N{\rENG}and get reinforcements,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.66,0:13:47.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,进取号早被拆成碎片了\N{\rENG}Enterprise will have been ripped to scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:55.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都有亲友在\N{\rENG}We all have people on...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:58.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我哥哥在那艘船上\N{\rENG}My brother is on that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:00.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,您是最高级的军官 我们都将服从您的命令\N{\rENG}As the ranking officer, we will follow your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想为您提供所有的相关信息\N{\rENG}I merely wished to provide you with all relevant information.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些信号是尼斯湖水怪嘴里那些\N{\rENG}Those are the signatures
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:07.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,被拆解的外星飞船所留下的\N{\rENG}from the picked-apart alien ships we saw in Nessie's gob.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:10.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,把那里放大点看 得吗\N{\rENG}Enhance that bit, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:17.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,其中的一艘是克林贡D7级战巡\N{\rENG}One of the vessels is a D7-class Klingon cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:18.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,里面可能有幸存者吗\N{\rENG}Could any of them have survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:20.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,极其不可能\N{\rENG}Highly unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,船体装甲板将会被拆解\N{\rENG}The hull plating would be disassembled,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:22.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有可呼吸空气都会泄漏出去\N{\rENG}venting all breathable air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,即便是克林贡人都不能杀出一条血路\N{\rENG}Even the Klingons couldn't fight their way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:27.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些拾荒者 他们从舰船上拿走中意的东西\N{\rENG}These scavengers, they take what they please from ships--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:30.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管舰员的死活 还要把这些技术篡改后据为己有\N{\rENG}damn the crew-- and pervert the tech into their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:31.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没法估量他们到底有多大能耐\N{\rENG}We've no idea what they're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:33.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔说得对\N{\rENG}Chapel's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:34.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果速度就是我们的武器 那好钢必须用在刀刃上\N{\rENG}If speed is our weapon, then we have to press it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.80,0:14:35.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么速度\N{\rENG}What speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:37.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 指挥官\N{\rENG}Uh, with all due respect, Commander--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:40.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是 代理舰长\N{\rENG}I mean, Acting Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:41.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是就是舰长\N{\rENG}Is it just Captain? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:44.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官 他们本可以轻松摧毁法拉格特号\N{\rENG}Sir, they easily could've destroyed the Farragut
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,或是把我们塞进那该死的巨大囊袋里掳走\N{\rENG}or made off with us tucked in their bloody huge pouch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:48.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他们没有这么做\N{\rENG}but they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:49.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你心里对此有什么推论吗\N{\rENG}And you have a theory as to why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:52.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能因为你的星舰受损太严重了\N{\rENG}Because your ship's so banged up
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,不值得他们去偷吧\N{\rENG}it wasn't worth stealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:57.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我需要你变出个奇迹了 斯考特先生\N{\rENG}Well, then I need you to perform some miracles, Mr. Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:14:59.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,按顺序 我们先弄引擎 再弄武器\N{\rENG}We need engines and weapons, in that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:00.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\rENG}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:01.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,把损伤修理好\N{\rENG}Patch up the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:02.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽快让它们重新上线\N{\rENG}Get them back to work as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:03.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得弄清楚\N{\rENG}We need to figure out where
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:04.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,那艘拾荒船要驶向哪里\N{\rENG}that scavenger ship is headed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:06.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样才能设法快他们一步\N{\rENG}so we can find a way to get there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:08.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样吧 让我们开工\N{\rENG}That's it. Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:23.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是怀念涡轮电梯啊\N{\rENG}Really missing the turbolift.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:25.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事 就剩八层甲板两条梯子要爬了\N{\rENG}Only eight decks and two access ladders left to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦不 别开枪\N{\rENG}Oh! Oh, no, don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:36.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,人活了五千年可不是为了挨枪子的\N{\rENG}You don't live to be 5,000 by getting yourself shot a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们正在前往轮机舱的路上\N{\rENG}We're on our way to Engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:39.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可不兴去了 除非你想\N{\rENG}Bad place to be right now unless you're fond
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:44.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,被自己汩汩涌出的鲜血呛死\N{\rENG}of choking to death on your own gurgling blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:45.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N{\rENG}Wh... From what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.81,0:15:47.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,都怪那条脐带\N{\rENG}The umbilical!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:49.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟着我 来\N{\rENG}Come with me. Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:52.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,那里弥漫着有毒气体\N{\rENG}It's flooded with toxic gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:55.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,它直接穿透了我们的船体\N{\rENG}It's tunneled straight through our hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:57.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,它已经接入了我们的动力系统\N{\rENG}It's tapped into our power systems,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.42,0:16:00.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,计算机网络和燃料贮箱\N{\rENG}our computer network, our fuel storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:04.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们连辅助动力都没剩多少\N{\rENG}We've barely any auxiliary power left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们不想法把它断掉\N{\rENG}If we don't disconnect it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:07.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,就没有足够的动力来逃脱了\N{\rENG}we will not have enough to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:08.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然空气是有毒的 我们需要戴上呼吸器\N{\rENG}If the air is toxic, we'll need breathers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,才能接近脐带\N{\rENG}to get close to the umbilical.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:12.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿上东西 米勒少尉会护卫你们的队伍\N{\rENG}Grab them. Ensign Miller will escort your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:13.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们摆脱了那东西的那一刻\N{\rENG}The second we disconnect from that thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,就要马上准备好逃离\N{\rENG}we need to be ready to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:16.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,是 舰长\N{\rENG}Yes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:24.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 给我听着\N{\rENG}Yeah, you heard right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:27.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好给我管用 你这小破玩意\N{\rENG}You better start doing your job, you daft piece of...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:28.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯科特先生\N{\rENG}Mr. Scott?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切进展顺利吗\N{\rENG}Everything okay in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:33.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,会的会的 只要我先拆几个东西出来\N{\rENG}Soon will be, once I've torn a few things out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:34.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后再把它们装回去\N{\rENG}and put them back proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:36.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后 这需要多久\N{\rENG}An-And how long will that take?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,正常的做法吗 两天\N{\rENG}To do it right? Two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:40.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,唔\N{\rENG}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:42.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不你先这样 先确保\N{\rENG}Why don't you start with doing it the way
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:44.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不会立即散架爆炸\N{\rENG}where we won't immediately explode,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:46.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后再在此基础上做点别的\N{\rENG}and we'll take it from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克和乌乎拉有突破了\N{\rENG}Spock and Uhura made a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:51.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗 哎哟\N{\rENG}Oh, aye? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:52.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,这艘拾荒船在赫利孔γ星\N{\rENG}The mineral that the scavenger ship was collecting
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:54.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,收集的矿物是奥登金\N{\rENG}at Helicon Gamma-- it was aldentium.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:56.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦我听过\N{\rENG}Oh, I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:59.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,有几个种族把它用在推进系统上\N{\rENG}A few species use it in their... propulsion systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,附近还有另一颗拥有大量矿藏的行星\N{\rENG}There's another world nearby with significant deposits--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,沙利文星 就在他们的路线上\N{\rENG}Sullivan's Planet-- directly in their path.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:07.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人居住吗\N{\rENG}Inhabited?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:09.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,超过一亿人口\N{\rENG}Over a hundred million people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:12.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且是曲速前文明 所以还有不干涉原则\N{\rENG}Pre-warp, so the non-interference directive
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,意味着我们不能直接警告他们\N{\rENG}means we can't warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我们也没别的手段做些什么\N{\rENG}Not that there's anything we could do anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:17.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,但听着 我们一定要比他们先到那里\N{\rENG}Listen, we need to get there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:19.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,给拾荒船设个埋伏\N{\rENG}Set a trap for the scavengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:21.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会是觉得 在他们抢跑了这么久之后\N{\rENG}You're not asking me to warp us past them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还能让咱们赶到他们前头去吧\N{\rENG}with the head start they've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:24.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样 恢复曲速动力我没问题\N{\rENG}Look, I can give us warp power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:27.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,但如果你觉得这东西\N{\rENG}but if you think this tub will hold together
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:30.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,都被砸成这样了 在高曲速下还能不散架\N{\rENG}at high speed after the beating she just took,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:32.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是少做白日梦了\N{\rENG}your bum's out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:34.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,等离子导管都\N{\rENG}The plasma manifolds...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:35.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\rENG}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不觉得你理解\N{\rENG}No, I'm not sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:38.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你拿到了个烂摊子 对吧\N{\rENG}You were handed a raw deal, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:40.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人会指责你搞砸了什么\N{\rENG}No one can fault you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:43.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,但如果我们把这艘船推得太猛 把她弄散架了\N{\rENG}But if we push this ship too hard and it fails,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是我们的问题了\N{\rENG}that's our fault, not theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是风险\N{\rENG}It's a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我把赌注压在我们自己身上\N{\rENG}But I am betting on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:52.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备进入最高曲速\N{\rENG}Prepare for maximum warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rENG}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我刚刚绕开了所有安全措施\N{\rENG}I just bypassed every safety feature
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:09.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,建立了与舰舵控制的直接连接\N{\rENG}to make a direct connection to the helm controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:12.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本该立即被电得魂飞魄散的\N{\rENG}I should've shocked the bejesus out of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:14.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,没把自己炸得灰头土脸你还失望了吗\N{\rENG}Disappointed you didn't set your hair on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果剩余的电力连让我触电都做不到\N{\rENG}If there's not enough power to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:17.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就更不够驱动星舰转向了\N{\rENG}there's nowhere near enough to steer the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:20.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,这声音是好迹象吗\N{\rENG}That's a good sound, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,这船不会叫得很开心吧\N{\rENG}The ship is happy screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:24.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,是提醒我们动作要快点了\N{\rENG}It's a reminder to work faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:26.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能人工点火推力器吗\N{\rENG}Can we fire the thrusters manually?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:30.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃 如果我们想死得痛快的话 可以\N{\rENG}I mean, we can if we want to very quickly die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:33.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,机动推力器使用化学反应点火\N{\rENG}The maneuvering thrusters use a chemical reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.60,0:18:35.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们可以手动触发\N{\rENG}They can be triggered by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,但没有通讯 我们就无法协调推力器的工作\N{\rENG}But with no comms, we'd have no way to coordinate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:40.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有传感器 我们就只能完全盲飞\N{\rENG}With no sensors, we'd be flying literally blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:42.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么要传感器 我们可以自己看\N{\rENG}Who needs sensors? We have eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:44.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,别忘了也没有护盾和偏导仪\N{\rENG}Add to that no shields or navigational deflector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:46.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要我们犯点错误\N{\rENG}If we make a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:47.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且这个情况下肯定会\N{\rENG}which we definitely would,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:49.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就要变成舱壁上的一团黑炭了\N{\rENG}we end up a scorch mark on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:50.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,通讯问题吗\N{\rENG}Communication issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:52.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我来得正好\N{\rENG}I got here just in time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:55.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可能是第一次\N{\rENG}This may be the first time I'm glad
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:58.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我庆幸自己在1980年代生活过\N{\rENG}to have lived through the 1980s.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:01.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\rENG}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:07.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,它直接连在了我们的电网上\N{\rENG}It is hooked directly into our power grid,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:09.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的计算机系统上 还有燃料吊舱上\N{\rENG}our computer systems, and our fuel pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:11.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以尝试用相位枪切断它\N{\rENG}We could try to sever it with our phasers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:13.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,释放出的能量会炸掉半艘船的\N{\rENG}That much energy would take out half the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:16.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\rENG}Cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:39.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不觉得他们能透过烟雾看清我们\N{\rENG}I don't think they can see us through the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:41.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,快把她带出去\N{\rENG}Let's get her out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌乎拉 情况报告\N{\rENG}Uhura, status.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,接近曲速七级 舰长\N{\rENG}Approaching warp seven, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:56.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,行吧 虽然这船现在基本是拿胶带粘起来的\N{\rENG}Well, Farragut may be held together by duct tape
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:59.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,但只要没散架就行\N{\rENG}at this point, but as long as it holds...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:03.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,传感器显示我们已经超越拾荒船了\N{\rENG}Sensors indicate we have overtaken the scavenger vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:05.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得不错 各位\N{\rENG}Excellent work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:08.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还有多久抵达沙利文星\N{\rENG}How long until we reach Sullivan's Planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:10.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,两个小时 如果能保持当前速度的话\N{\rENG}Two hours, if we can maintain this speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果之前有任何人跟我说 这是不可能的\N{\rENG}I will be accepting drinks in the galley
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:18.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,一会都得来餐厅请我几杯酒\N{\rENG}from everyone who said that this was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:24.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然 是在我们把你们的船救出来之后\N{\rENG}After we have saved your ship, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:25.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\rENG}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,报告\N{\rENG}Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:58.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们掉出了曲速\N{\rENG}Well, we've dropped out of warp,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,并且失去了所有引擎动力\N{\rENG}and I've lost all engine power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:01.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长 按照计划 现在我们\N{\rENG}Captain, our stratagem has put us
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:02.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,直接位于拾荒船前方的路径上\N{\rENG}directly in the path of the scavenger vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很清楚 史波克\N{\rENG}I am aware, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:05.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你说过的 等离子导管全炸开花了\N{\rENG}It's the plasma manifolds-- they've blown out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:06.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就想尽一切办法\N{\rENG}Well, then take whoever you need
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:08.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,用你能用的一切资源和人力去修\N{\rENG}and get down there and fix them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们直接炸没了 没法修了\N{\rENG}They are gone! Beyond repair!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:10.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在得进船坞\N{\rENG}We'll need to put into spacedock now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:12.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,才能更换它们了\N{\rENG}and replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:16.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们 我们把她推得太猛了\N{\rENG}We just... we pushed her too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.11,0:21:18.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在只能坐以待毙了\N{\rENG}We're dead in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:27.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你了 我检查过读数了\N{\rENG}I told you, I rechecked the numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.58,0:21:29.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且检查了三次 三次都告诉我\N{\rENG}and re-rechecked them, and all three times confirmed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在曲速引擎就是个超大号镇纸 什么用也不顶了\N{\rENG}the warp engines are now giant paperweights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:33.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还有一部分脉冲动力\N{\rENG}We still have some impulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,但也不够\N{\rENG}Not nearly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:37.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看我们能做的就是装死\N{\rENG}I'm afraid all we can do is play dead
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.80,0:21:40.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望拾荒船能再次忽略我们\N{\rENG}and hope the scavenger ignores us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.10,0:21:42.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,有可能他们还是只打算去快乐地吞掉行星\N{\rENG}There's a chance it'll just go on its merry planet-eating way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:45.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的另一个选项是弃舰并使用穿梭机撤离\N{\rENG}Our other option is to abandon ship and escape by shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.31,0:21:48.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以派一架穿梭机到最近的子空间通讯中继\N{\rENG}We could take one to the nearest subspace relay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:49.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后呼叫星际舰队\N{\rENG}and hail Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:50.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我们到的时候\N{\rENG}By the time we get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,沙利文星上的所有人早就死透了\N{\rENG}everyone on Sullivan's Planet will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:53.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,结论就是 两个选择都很灾难\N{\rENG}So we're agreed, both options are terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:56.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们总得选一个 一个小时后他们就到那了\N{\rENG}but we have to pick one. In one hour it'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:21:59.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只有一个小时来决定哪个更不灾难一些\N{\rENG}That's how long we've got to decide which is least terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:01.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,这也不是我们能决定的\N{\rENG}That is not our decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:07.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我哪个都不选\N{\rENG}I pick neither option.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:12.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 那很勇敢了 而且 如果你不介意我这么说的话\N{\rENG}Okay. That is a bold and-- if you don't mind me saying--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.44,0:22:14.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,简直离谱到家了\N{\rENG}highly unorthodox choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:15.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:16.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官 他只是很担心\N{\rENG}Sir, he's just concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.04,0:22:18.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们还扣着我们的人\N{\rENG}They have our crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.72,0:22:21.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且正在前往一颗有人居住的行星\N{\rENG}and the planet they're headed for is inhabited.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:22.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们无法警告他们 除非\N{\rENG}We won't be able to warn them without...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:23.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 乌乎拉少尉\N{\rENG}Thank you, Ensign Uhura.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:25.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我对情况很清楚\N{\rENG}I'm up to speed on the particulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.88,0:22:27.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有进一步解释的必要\N{\rENG}No need for further discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.45,0:22:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么给你选项呢\N{\rENG}Then how will we provide you with options?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:31.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要选项\N{\rENG}I don't need options.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.20,0:22:33.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要你们喋喋不休\N{\rENG}I don't need chattering voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:35.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在需要清空头脑\N{\rENG}What I need is to clear my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:37.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我现在没办法\N{\rENG}And I can't do it with all this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.53,0:22:46.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 情况本来可以更好的\N{\rENG}Well, that could have gone better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:48.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能 怎么可能\N{\rENG}No. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:50.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是他第一次坐舰长椅 是吧\N{\rENG}This is his first time in the chair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:53.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,他以前也接管过指挥 但从来没像这样\N{\rENG}He's had the conn before but never like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.94,0:22:56.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,他表现出典型的受胁迫下的紧张迹象\N{\rENG}He's showing classic signs of strain under duress.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:22:57.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他感受到的压力肯定很\N{\rENG}The pressure he must be feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:22:59.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊 太棒了 起初他还无所顾忌\N{\rENG}Aye, great. First he's reckless,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:01.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在他又要跟树枝一样一折就断了\N{\rENG}now he's liable to snap like a twig.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:04.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,假设他真断了 那怎么样 嗯\N{\rENG}Let's say he does. What then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:07.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就要采取措施来\N{\rENG}We would take steps to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:09.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,解除他的指挥权\N{\rENG}remove him from command.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:12.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,那 那些措施具体是什么\N{\rENG}And... what would those steps be, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:14.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,作为舰上当前最高级别的医疗军官\N{\rENG}As ranking medical officer on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:16.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有权评估他的健康状况\N{\rENG}it's within my power to evaluate him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.86,0:23:19.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,并在他在心理上不适合的情况下 解除他的职务\N{\rENG}and, if he is mentally unfit, remove him from duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:23.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 在我们考虑这条路之前\N{\rENG}Okay, before we even think about going down this road,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.27,0:23:24.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该先考虑\N{\rENG}we should consider
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:26.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还能工作 这只是他的风格\N{\rENG}that he's still working on his command style.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.64,0:23:29.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,对啊 现在他的风格是装死\N{\rENG}Aye. Right now his style is lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:31.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是问题\N{\rENG}That's my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:32.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们或许可以帮助他找到方法\N{\rENG}Maybe we can help him find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:34.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以前见过他处理危机\N{\rENG}I've seen him in a crisis before,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:37.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,他没有被迫当舰长的压力的时候\N{\rENG}when he didn't have the pressures of being captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.90,0:23:41.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,他能看到连我都想不到的自己的潜力\N{\rENG}He saw something in me that I hadn't seen in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.85,0:23:43.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,这救了我的命\N{\rENG}It saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:46.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得他只是需要有人提醒\N{\rENG}I think he just needs to be reminded
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:48.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,他身上也有这种潜力\N{\rENG}that same thing is in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.33,0:23:50.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们中就有人需要和他谈谈\N{\rENG}Well, one of us should talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.20,0:23:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很显然很激动\N{\rENG}He is clearly agitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:54.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,或许风格更冷静的人\N{\rENG}Perhaps someone with a less emotional style
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.13,0:23:56.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,去和他谈 会更有效果\N{\rENG}might be more effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:08.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫雷尔 撑住\N{\rENG}Maurer... come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.68,0:24:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫雷尔 清醒点\N{\rENG}Maurer, stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:11.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,来不及了  必须现在治疗她\N{\rENG}She can't wait. We have to treat her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.85,0:24:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在 那两个家伙还在外面晃荡呢\N{\rENG}What, with those two things roaming around?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.35,0:24:14.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,别无选择了\N{\rENG}We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.66,0:24:24.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,没法对他们造成任何伤害\N{\rENG}They're not taking any damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.03,0:24:26.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,进这里 左舷餐厅\N{\rENG}In here, the Port Galley.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.78,0:24:33.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有毒气 安全了\N{\rENG}No fumes. We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:38.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,她在大出血\N{\rENG}She's bleeding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.68,0:24:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要医疗箱\N{\rENG}I need a medkit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.04,0:24:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下 我觉得\N{\rENG}Wait, wait, wait, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.16,0:24:49.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是我们有通讯器和能用的传送器\N{\rENG}If we had comms and a functioning transporter,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.08,0:24:50.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,是能救她的\N{\rENG}we could have saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:52.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,未必 那些离子粒子\N{\rENG}You don't know. Those ion particles
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像子弹一样 能撕裂皮肉和骨骼\N{\rENG}are like bullets. They rip through flesh and bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.26,0:24:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然原始 但杀伤力十足\N{\rENG}primitive but effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.62,0:25:09.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,可他们的防护服却异常先进\N{\rENG}And yet their suits are highly advanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.24,0:25:11.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我从没见过能吸收相位枪火力的设备\N{\rENG}I have never seen a device absorb phaser fire like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.30,0:25:12.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不合常理\N{\rENG}It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.62,0:25:13.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,或许他们来自\N{\rENG}Maybe they're from some
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:15.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,宇宙中某个永远无法用常理解释的阴暗角落\N{\rENG}dark corner of the cosmos that'll never make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.42,0:25:17.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得想办法解决他们的护甲防御\N{\rENG}We have to find a way to get through their defenses somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.82,0:25:21.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人见过他们 但我知道\N{\rENG}No one has ever seen them, but I know
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.22,0:25:23.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,即便是戈恩人 也把他们视作怪物\N{\rENG}they were considered monsters, even by the Gorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.40,0:25:25.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,相位枪调至击杀模式\N{\rENG}Set phasers to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.78,0:25:48.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可是我从伊塞奈特酿酒厂进口的酒\N{\rENG}I had this imported from an Ithenite distillery.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.32,0:25:50.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会赔你一瓶的\N{\rENG}I'll get you another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.28,0:26:19.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像我的一位老朋友曾经说的\N{\rENG}As an old friend of mine once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.95,0:26:22.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,「要有光」\N{\rENG}"Let there be light."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.02,0:26:25.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点进来吧\N{\rENG}Come, come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.45,0:26:27.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,她的舱室\N{\rENG}Her quarters are...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.82,0:26:30.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,和我想象中的一模一样\N{\rENG}exactly what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.63,0:26:35.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这 不对 好了\N{\rENG}Here. No, no. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.59,0:26:37.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\rENG}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:38.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是你\N{\rENG}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.83,0:26:40.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以前倒是活泼\N{\rENG}You were once bouncy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.50,0:26:42.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,又开朗 可新鲜劲一过\N{\rENG}and cheerful, but when the novelty wore off,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.57,0:26:44.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,就有点吓人了\N{\rENG}you got a little creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.37,0:26:45.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些破烂玩意儿\N{\rENG}How is any of this junk
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.67,0:26:47.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么帮我们飞离这里啊\N{\rENG}going to help us fly out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.21,0:26:48.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\rENG}Oh, my goodness,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.68,0:26:51.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以前就靠这个操控过不少星舰呢\N{\rENG}I piloted many a starship with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.01,0:26:54.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然是8比特的船嘛\N{\rENG}Granted, they were 8-bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.55,0:26:57.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,但周五晚上玩这个还挺有意思的\N{\rENG}but it was a good time on a Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.18,0:26:59.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊 找到了\N{\rENG}Ah, found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.22,0:27:00.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\rENG}Take.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.85,0:27:03.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,这该不会是\N{\rENG}Is this a, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.96,0:27:05.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,个人按摩器吧\N{\rENG}personal massager?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:10.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 这在以前可是最先进的通讯器\N{\rENG}Oh, this was once a state-of-the-art communicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.13,0:27:11.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,得插在墙上才能用\N{\rENG}You had to plug it into the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:15.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过要是有人烦你 你就能让他们一直等着\N{\rENG}but if people annoyed you, you'd put them on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.90,0:27:17.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该还有更多的\N{\rENG}I think there are more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.67,0:27:19.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以信号是通过有线传输的\N{\rENG}So the signals are grounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.97,0:27:22.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,从一根线缆直接传到另一根线缆\N{\rENG}transmitted cable to cable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.21,0:27:23.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,拿着那个\N{\rENG}Take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.58,0:27:27.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样就能防止信号被干扰了\N{\rENG}Which will insulate them from being jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.38,0:27:28.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要让船员们\N{\rENG}We're going to have the crew
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.65,0:27:31.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,拆除船上所有的铜缆\N{\rENG}strip the ship for copper cables,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.15,0:27:34.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后给进取号重新布线\N{\rENG}and we're going to wire the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.53,0:27:41.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去吧\N{\rENG}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.11,0:27:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和维瑞尔舰长之前有一局棋没下完\N{\rENG}Captain V'Rel and I had an ongoing game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.54,0:28:00.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我第一次觉得\N{\rENG}For the first time, I think I was
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.18,0:28:01.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,自己快要赢她了\N{\rENG}on my way to beating her,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.58,0:28:03.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我们始终没机会结束那局\N{\rENG}but we never had the chance to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:04.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得当时棋盘就摆成这样\N{\rENG}I think this is how we left the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.88,0:28:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我打扰\N{\rENG}If I may interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.12,0:28:07.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 你已经打扰了\N{\rENG}Oh, you already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.45,0:28:09.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,别停\N{\rENG}Don't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.02,0:28:11.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你否决了两个有缺陷的方案\N{\rENG}You rightly dismissed two flawed courses of action,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,但时间紧迫 我们需要新计划\N{\rENG}but time is short and we require a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.93,0:28:17.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,轮到维瑞尔走棋 我已经把她逼入绝境了\N{\rENG}It was V'Rel's move, and I had her in a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.77,0:28:21.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是能想到她接下来会怎么走就好了\N{\rENG}If I could just figure out what she would have done next.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:23.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在是代理舰长 船员们都在等你\N{\rENG}You are acting captain. Your crew is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.54,0:28:25.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,让他们等太久对事态\N{\rENG}To keep them waiting longer would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.47,0:28:27.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有好处\N{\rENG}...not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.78,0:28:29.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\rENG}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.51,0:28:33.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我慌了神\N{\rENG}I'm frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:34.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,这倒让我有点意外\N{\rENG}I find this surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.28,0:28:36.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你哥哥常说\N{\rENG}Your brother speaks often
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.12,0:28:37.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一直想要指挥星舰\N{\rENG}of your aspirations for command
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.05,0:28:39.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,也很有领导才能\N{\rENG}and of your affinity for leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.82,0:28:41.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实他原话是\N{\rENG}Actually, he said
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.22,0:28:42.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不管面对谁\N{\rENG}you are not afraid to throw your weight around,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.45,0:28:43.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,都敢直言发令 毫不含糊\N{\rENG}no matter who's in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.59,0:28:45.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 这倒像山姆会说的话\N{\rENG}Yeah, that sounds like Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.51,0:28:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,某种程度上 他说得没错\N{\rENG}And in a way he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.74,0:28:51.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,从我加入星舰学院那天起\N{\rENG}From the moment I joined the Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.08,0:28:53.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就下定决心要比任何人都快地\N{\rENG}I was determined to sit in that chair
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:55.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐上那把舰长椅\N{\rENG}faster than anyone before me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:58.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我觉得自己比别人更懂行\N{\rENG}because I thought I knew better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.07,0:28:59.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,觉得自己比别人更优秀\N{\rENG}I thought I was better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.60,0:29:01.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,每当我觉得命令不合理时\N{\rENG}Whenever orders don't make sense to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.56,0:29:03.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且我总是觉得不合理\N{\rENG}which happens more often than I'd like,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.44,0:29:07.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我总想 该由我来下达命令才对\N{\rENG}I always think that I should be the one giving them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.84,0:29:11.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,之前 我让维雷尔舰长派一支登陆小队\N{\rENG}Earlier, I told Captain V'Rel to send a landing party
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.48,0:29:12.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,去赫利孔γ星\N{\rENG}to Helicon Gamma.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.68,0:29:16.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我当时极力劝说她\N{\rENG}I pushed her hard on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.60,0:29:20.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,还好她没听我的\N{\rENG}Thank God she ignored me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.49,0:29:23.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,不然爆炸时 我们只能在地表等死\N{\rENG}otherwise we'd all be standing on the surface when it exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.20,0:29:26.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,优秀的舰长知道该何时倾听\N{\rENG}Good leaders know when to listen
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.27,0:29:27.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,何时坚持己见\N{\rENG}and when not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.66,0:29:31.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我连这一点也没做到\N{\rENG}Well, I failed at that test, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.14,0:29:33.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯科特先生也警告过我\N{\rENG}Mr. Scott warned me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.18,0:29:34.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要强行启动引擎\N{\rENG}not to push the engines,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.44,0:29:35.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我还是命令他这么做了\N{\rENG}but I ordered him to anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:38.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这段时间一直凭直觉行事\N{\rENG}I've been flying by the seat of my pants this whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.72,0:29:39.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,一次次做决定\N{\rENG}making call after call
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:42.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,却完全不知道这些决定会带我们走向何方\N{\rENG}with no clue where they'd lead us,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.45,0:29:43.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,只能指望自己碰巧选对\N{\rENG}hoping I'd luck into the right one,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.95,0:29:46.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果却让我们困在这\N{\rENG}and all I did was put us belly up in the path of
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.32,0:29:47.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,直面那个什么终极毁灭者\N{\rENG}the ultimate destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.85,0:29:49.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你确实陷入了信心危机\N{\rENG}And now you are having a crisis of confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.46,0:29:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你还是得继续领导大家\N{\rENG}but you still have to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.76,0:29:53.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,说真的 我也想啊\N{\rENG}Believe me, I'd love to,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.38,0:29:55.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我现在完全没头绪\N{\rENG}but there's nothing coming to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.53,0:30:02.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我妈妈常说一句话\N{\rENG}My mom was fond of an expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:06.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,「实现目标的人 往往不知道接下来该怎么办」\N{\rENG}"The dog who caught the car."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:11.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,如今我终于有了机会\N{\rENG}Now that I've finally latched onto one...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.05,0:30:16.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,却不知道该怎么应对\N{\rENG}...I have no idea what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.62,0:30:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,在瓦肯星 我们也有一句类似的话\N{\rENG}On Vulcan, we have a similar expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.19,0:30:24.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,「咬到自己尾巴的赛拉兽」\N{\rENG}"The sehlat who ate its tail."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.16,0:30:26.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我要指出 你比那种\N{\rENG}Though I would point out you have
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.56,0:30:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,四足野兽有更多的优势\N{\rENG}a significant leg up over a quadrupedal beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.96,0:30:30.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的人类直觉\N{\rENG}Your human intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.63,0:30:33.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,它一直指引着我们 我们现在还都好好活着\N{\rENG}It has guided us this far. We are all still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.78,0:30:35.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我建议你继续相信它\N{\rENG}I recommend you keep following it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.76,0:30:42.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.78,0:30:45.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然你这么说\N{\rENG}If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.96,0:30:50.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯科提 那艘拾荒船还有多久到\N{\rENG}Scotty, how long until that scavenger ship gets here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.66,0:30:53.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,不到 20 分钟 但这只是估算\N{\rENG}Less than 20 minutes, but that's just an estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.70,0:30:54.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我来说够了\N{\rENG}Well, it's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.56,0:30:57.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你回来了 长官\N{\rENG}Glad to see you back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.84,0:30:59.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\rENG}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.23,0:31:02.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我们开局不顺\N{\rENG}Look, I know we got off to a rough start here,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.64,0:31:05.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说什么也弥补不了这一点\N{\rENG}and there's nothing I can say that can make up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.48,0:31:08.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且激昂的演讲也不是我的强项\N{\rENG}Rousing speeches aren't exactly my forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.10,0:31:09.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官 我觉得你说得很好\N{\rENG}I think you're doing just fine, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.00,0:31:13.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我要跟在座各位说清楚\N{\rENG}But let me be crystal clear to each of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.41,0:31:15.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,即便我之前的行为让你们有别的想法\N{\rENG}Even if my actions indicated otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.66,0:31:19.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也绝不会放弃营救进取号\N{\rENG}I have no intention of giving up on rescuing the Enterprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.42,0:31:21.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,毕竟我们两队船员的生命都危在旦夕\N{\rENG}not with the lives of both of our crews on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.72,0:31:23.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢您 长官 我正需要听到这句话\N{\rENG}Thank you, sir. I needed to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.80,0:31:25.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也需要听听你们的想法\N{\rENG}And I need to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.90,0:31:27.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在掌握了什么情况\N{\rENG}What do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.06,0:31:29.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,除了我们困在太空中动弹不得之外\N{\rENG}Besides the fact that we're dead in space,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.02,0:31:31.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于这些拾荒者 我们还知道什么\N{\rENG}what do we know about these scavengers?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.40,0:31:33.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的船肯定有什么弱点\N{\rENG}Their ship has to have some kind of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.96,0:31:36.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌乎拉 你观察到了什么\N{\rENG}Uhura, what have you seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.72,0:31:38.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,里面有很多船\N{\rENG}Ships, a lot of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.46,0:31:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,来自象限的各个角落 它掳走船只\N{\rENG}from across the quadrant. It appropriates them,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.13,0:31:42.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,窃取它们的能力\N{\rENG}steals their functionality,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.47,0:31:43.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后为己所用\N{\rENG}and bends that to its own needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.77,0:31:45.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且它的欲望永无止境\N{\rENG}And its needs are bottomless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.27,0:31:47.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,它只懂得不断吞噬 让自己变得更大\N{\rENG}All it does is consume and make itself bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.38,0:31:49.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,它变得越大 需要的就越多\N{\rENG}The bigger it gets, the more it requires.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.88,0:31:51.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后就会去吞噬下一个资源 就是\N{\rENG}Then it moves on to devour the next resource, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.81,0:31:52.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,它永远不会停下\N{\rENG}it will never stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.95,0:31:54.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,它永远不会满足\N{\rENG}you know, it'll never have enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.45,0:31:57.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 斯科提 你刚才已经找到了他们的弱点\N{\rENG}Exactly. Scotty, you just found their weakness:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.32,0:31:59.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,极度过分的吞噬欲\N{\rENG}their ravenous need to consume.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,无尽的贪欲\N{\rENG}Bottomless greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.82,0:32:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以利用这点来对抗它们\N{\rENG}We can use that against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.02,0:32:03.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,该怎么做\N{\rENG}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.63,0:32:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就要轮到你出场了\N{\rENG}That's where you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.50,0:32:08.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要你用奥登金充满等离子歧管\N{\rENG}I need you to fill the plasma manifold
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.38,0:32:10.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到溢出为止\N{\rENG}until it's overflowing with aldentium.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:11.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 歧管只是个没用的壳子\N{\rENG}No-no, the-the manifold's a useless husk,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.43,0:32:13.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,况且船上连一滴奥登金都没有\N{\rENG}and we don't have a drop of aldentium on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.00,0:32:16.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只需要让它看起来像\N{\rENG}We just need to make it look like we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.20,0:32:17.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,随着奥登金衰变\N{\rENG}As aldentium decays,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:18.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个过程中会释放出很多反质子\N{\rENG}it gives off lots of anti-protons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.82,0:32:20.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以用反质子来填充混合室\N{\rENG}Well, I could flood the intermix chamber with anti-protons
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.77,0:32:22.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们的引擎看起来像是由奥登金驱动的\N{\rENG}and make it look like our engines run on aldentium.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.87,0:32:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们会发现我们的踪迹 被我们的排气管吸引过来\N{\rENG}They'll catch the scent and gravitate towards our tailpipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:27.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要把法拉格特号\N{\rENG}We are going to make the Farragut
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.55,0:32:31.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,伪装成一场令拾荒者垂涎欲滴的盛宴\N{\rENG}into a banquet that's impossible for these scavengers to resist, 
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.04,0:32:32.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,当它们来赴宴时\N{\rENG}and when they come to dine,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.15,0:32:34.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,就该后悔得肠子都青了\N{\rENG}we're going to make them regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.16,0:32:39.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长已经下令了\N{\rENG}The captain has given his orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.53,0:32:49.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是觉得这么叫怪怪的 维瑞尔还活着呢\N{\rENG}I still feel funny being called that while V'Rel's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.14,0:32:52.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证一有机会就会尽快给你降职\N{\rENG}I promise to demote you at the earliest opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.71,0:32:59.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 所以在这些拾荒者尝试吃掉我们的时候 我们又该怎么办\N{\rENG}Wait, so what exactly do we do after we get these scavengers to try and eat us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.01,0:33:01.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是这个计划有点疯狂的地方了\N{\rENG}Here's where the plan gets a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.21,0:33:03.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么这个计划有点疯狂的地方\N{\rENG}This is where the plan gets crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.56,0:33:04.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,幸好你正坐着呢 查普尔护士\N{\rENG}Glad you're sitting down, Nurse Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.88,0:33:06.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,尤其是你 斯考特先生\N{\rENG}You especially, Mr. Scott,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.09,0:33:09.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢这个的\N{\rENG}are not going to love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.90,0:33:25.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,拉安\N{\rENG}La'An!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:29.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,{\i1}警告 环境指标危险
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.49,0:34:47.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\rENG}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.32,0:34:48.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,还好\N{\rENG}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.72,0:34:52.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,它没有开枪\N{\rENG}It... didn't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.96,0:34:56.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么它不杀了我\N{\rENG}Why didn't it kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.74,0:35:10.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可能只有一分钟的时间\N{\rENG}We may only have a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.91,0:35:12.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,该怎么把这死东西从我的船上弄下来\N{\rENG}How do we get this thing the hell off my ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.76,0:35:15.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们不能切断它 那么说服它们呢\N{\rENG}Well, if we can't disconnect it, what if we convince them to?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:17.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,-什么意思 -让它们自愿断开连接\N{\rENG}- How do you mean? - Make them want to disconnect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.24,0:35:19.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,让它们尝到点\N{\rENG}Give them a taste of something...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.45,0:35:20.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,难吃的东西\N{\rENG}highly undesirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.56,0:35:22.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我懂了 让它觉得反胃酸了\N{\rENG}I see, stir up a little acid reflux?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.84,0:35:24.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rENG}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.02,0:35:25.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,重子粒子如何\N{\rENG}What about, uh, baryon particles?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.74,0:35:27.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,那它们的燃料和美好的一天就都该完蛋了\N{\rENG}That would ruin their fuel and their day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.29,0:35:28.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们其中一个必须进入曲速引擎下面的\N{\rENG}One of us would have to access the waste system
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.86,0:35:30.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,废物处理系统\N{\rENG}beneath the warp drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.20,0:35:32.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,废物处理系统 好吧 你去吧\N{\rENG}Waste system? All right, you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:36.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得把燃料管道隔离\N{\rENG}I have to isolate the fuel line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.54,0:35:39.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有  拿一个超耦合器过来\N{\rENG}And bring a hyper coupler.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.11,0:35:41.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,拉安\N{\rENG}La'An
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.67,0:35:44.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心点 还有一个外星人活着\N{\rENG}Be careful, that other alien's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.26,0:36:01.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们 上次我干这种话\N{\rENG}Ladies, I haven't done this
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.83,0:36:04.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是给死人乐队打杂的时候呢\N{\rENG}since I was a roadie for the Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.40,0:36:07.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这个种族还可以和死人交流吗\N{\rENG}Your species can communicate with dead people?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.80,0:36:09.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\rENG}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.44,0:36:10.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\rENG}Ah, ah, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.94,0:36:13.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,上尉 找你的\N{\rENG}Uh, uh, Lieutenant, it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.16,0:36:18.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\rENG}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.92,0:36:20.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,右舷推进器已经准备好了\N{\rENG}Starboard thrusters are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.36,0:36:22.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,左舷推进器也准备就绪\N{\rENG}Port thrusters standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.18,0:36:27.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 艾丽卡 小心别坠机\N{\rENG}Okay, Erica, don't crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:37.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,拾荒者星舰已脱离曲速\N{\rENG}The scavenger vessel has dropped out of warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.76,0:36:40.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,反质子 正在反着质子\N{\rENG}Anti-protons... anti-protoning?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.43,0:36:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在已经美味到极限了\N{\rENG}We're as juicy a target as I can make us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.93,0:36:44.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,红色警报 各岗位准备\N{\rENG}Red alert. All stations prepare for...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.84,0:36:49.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 准备被吃\N{\rENG}...well, for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.38,0:36:50.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,脉冲引擎准备\N{\rENG}Ready impulse engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.82,0:36:51.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,已就绪\N{\rENG}Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.08,0:36:53.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,她掌舵过多少次\N{\rENG}How many times has she helmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.21,0:36:54.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,两次 包括这次\N{\rENG}Twice, including now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.26,0:36:57.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,脉冲全速 乌乎拉\N{\rENG}Full impulse, Uhura.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.58,0:37:14.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯考提 轮到你了\N{\rENG}Scotty, your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:15.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你坚持的话\N{\rENG}If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.67,0:37:16.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我坚持 斯考特先生\N{\rENG}I do, Mr. Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.90,0:37:19.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我口令分离\N{\rENG}Detach at my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.14,0:37:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,分离\N{\rENG}Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.20,0:37:33.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克\N{\rENG}Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.69,0:37:37.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,贪吃蛇咬到自己尾巴了 舰长\N{\rENG}The sehlat has eaten its tail, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.12,0:37:39.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,拾荒者星舰已被瘫痪\N{\rENG}The scavenger ship has been disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.54,0:37:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌乎拉 尽快找到进取号\N{\rENG}Uhura, get us line of sight to the Enterprise as quickly as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.46,0:37:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,接收到信号传输\N{\rENG}Incoming transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.00,0:37:50.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,是法拉格特号 仅音频\N{\rENG}It's the Farragut, audio only.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.34,0:37:51.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,进取号 能收到吗\N{\rENG}Enterprise, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.67,0:37:53.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,可算来了啊 少尉\N{\rENG}Took you long enough, Ensign.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.20,0:37:54.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴听到你的声音\N{\rENG}Good to hear your voice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.80,0:37:57.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们受损严重 但是我们已经瘫痪了拾荒者星舰\N{\rENG}We're pretty banged up, but we disabled the scavenger ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.72,0:37:59.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉她这只是暂时的\N{\rENG}Tell her it's just temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.48,0:38:00.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,能持续多久\N{\rENG}How temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不清楚 但这是你们的机会\N{\rENG}No idea, but this is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.58,0:38:03.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,越狱的机会\N{\rENG}For a jailbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.89,0:38:12.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,左 右舷推进器\N{\rENG}Port and starboard thrusters,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.66,0:38:14.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,百分之十动力\N{\rENG}give me ten percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.13,0:38:18.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得关闭推进器 我们还没脱离束缚\N{\rENG}we got to kill those thrusters. We are not off-leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.86,0:38:22.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长 找到燃料线路了吗\N{\rENG}Captain, any luck finding the fuel line?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.60,0:38:25.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有一个相当可靠的猜测\N{\rENG}I've got a pretty solid guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.84,0:38:30.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,把那个连接器递给我\N{\rENG}Hand me that connector?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.32,0:38:33.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好后退一步\N{\rENG}And you might want to take a step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.88,0:38:37.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果爆炸 整个工程部船体都会被炸掉\N{\rENG}If it explodes, it will take out the entire engineering hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.55,0:38:38.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,多退几步吧\N{\rENG}A big step, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.90,0:38:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,重子粒子正在进入氘粒子流\N{\rENG}Baryon particles are entering the deuterium stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.70,0:38:54.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,混合物 正在失去稳定\N{\rENG}The mixture is... destabilizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:55.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,趁我们还没被这东西吸走\N{\rENG}Let's get the hell out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.70,0:38:57.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,赶紧跑路吧\N{\rENG}before we get sucked out with this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.14,0:39:07.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\rENG}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.06,0:39:08.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,紧急系统正在重启\N{\rENG}Emergency systems are rebooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.03,0:39:10.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长做到了 这些脐带正在脱离\N{\rENG}Captain did it. The umbilical's detached.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.75,0:39:12.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,左 右舷推进器\N{\rENG}Port and starboard thrusters,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.25,0:39:13.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,百分之五十\N{\rENG}50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.52,0:39:15.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,右舷推进器减缓点\N{\rENG}Ease off starboard thrusters. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.90,0:39:18.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,别减这么多 给我百分之三十\N{\rENG}N-Not that easy. Give me 30%.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.32,0:39:20.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,百分之五十 现在等下\N{\rENG}50%. Now wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.32,0:39:21.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,五十 八十\N{\rENG}50, 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.56,0:39:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,切断右舷推进器\N{\rENG}Cut starboard thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.10,0:39:27.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不想说风凉话 但是你要撞墙\N{\rENG}Hate to backseat-drive, but you're hitting the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.57,0:39:28.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,左舷推进器全速\N{\rENG}Full port thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.03,0:39:30.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,推进器控制无响应\N{\rENG}Thruster controls aren't responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.97,0:39:32.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,这要完蛋了\N{\rENG}That's real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.54,0:39:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 我有个想法\N{\rENG}Wait, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.87,0:39:35.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,洗耳恭听\N{\rENG}I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.87,0:39:38.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,中校?\N{\rENG}Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.28,0:39:41.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,中校?\N{\rENG}Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.67,0:40:07.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,好 右舷推进器动力20%\N{\rENG}Yes! Starboard thrusters to 20%.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.60,0:40:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,保持平衡\N{\rENG}Keep us even.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.46,0:40:13.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\rENG}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.82,0:40:16.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,是拾荒者\N{\rENG}The scavenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.88,0:40:21.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,拾荒者星舰的系统正在恢复运行\N{\rENG}The scavenger vessel's systems are coming back on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.92,0:40:23.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们正在瞄准进取号\N{\rENG}They are targeting Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.66,0:40:24.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,相位炮锁定\N{\rENG}Lock phasers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.89,0:40:26.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\rENG}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.76,0:40:27.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长 我们的武器无法\N{\rENG}Sir, the grapplers have proven
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.99,0:40:29.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,有效应对那些抓钩\N{\rENG}to be resistant to our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.83,0:40:31.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 史波克\N{\rENG}Okay, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.06,0:40:33.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有什么主意吗\N{\rENG}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.65,0:41:30.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克先生 扫描残骸中的生命信号\N{\rENG}Mr. Spock, scan the debris for life signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.69,0:41:38.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,近7000个生命信号\N{\rENG}Approximately 7,000 life signs,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.60,0:41:40.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,在迅速减少\N{\rENG}but they are dwindling quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.34,0:41:42.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能把生还者传送到船上吗\N{\rENG}Can we beam survivors aboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.34,0:41:45.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有心无力\N{\rENG}Not even if we wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.74,0:41:48.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,残骸的碎片会影响传送器 无法锁定\N{\rENG}There's too much debris to get a transporter lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.11,0:41:56.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\rENG}Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.98,0:41:58.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些生命信号\N{\rENG}The life signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.48,0:42:00.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 史波克先生\N{\rENG}Yes, Mr. Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.44,0:42:28.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些生命信号全都是人类\N{\rENG}The life signs are all human.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.79,0:42:42.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,船体上的标记\N{\rENG}The markings on the hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.10,0:42:45.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能看得更清楚一点吗\N{\rENG}Can you get us a clearer image?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.56,0:42:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.94,0:43:01.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在历史数据库里找到了这个\N{\rENG}I found this in our historical database.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.50,0:43:05.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,21世纪中期\N{\rENG}In the mid-21st century,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.45,0:43:07.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,在与瓦肯人的第一次接触之前\N{\rENG}before first contact with the Vulcans,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.52,0:43:09.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一群科学家 他们认为\N{\rENG}a group of scientists believed
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.43,0:43:13.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,岌岌可危的地球环境\N{\rENG}that Earth's environmental crisis was too severe
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.50,0:43:16.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有复原的可能 所以他们建造了一艘飞船\N{\rENG}to recover from, so they built a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.22,0:43:19.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们希望这艘船能让人类文明\N{\rENG}They hoped it would carry humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.10,0:43:21.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,在其他世界中继续生根发芽\N{\rENG}to civilizations in other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.73,0:43:24.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,但事与愿违\N{\rENG}But it failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.17,0:43:26.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,这艘船消失了\N{\rENG}The ship disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.37,0:43:29.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,全体船员\N{\rENG}The entire crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.27,0:43:32.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的家人 都消失了\N{\rENG}their families, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:37.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,此后音讯全无\N{\rENG}Never heard from again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.72,0:43:41.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还记得这艘船发射升空时的事\N{\rENG}I remember when it launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.79,0:43:46.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,那时我们还没有发明曲速引擎\N{\rENG}We-we hadn't yet invented warp drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.97,0:43:51.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,第三次世界大战才堪堪结束\N{\rENG}We'd barely put out the fires of the Third World War.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:54.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,熬过战争的国家不多 其中一个\N{\rENG}One of the few nations left standing
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.83,0:43:58.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,在他们残存的航天计划中挑选\N{\rENG}sifted through the ashes of their space program,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.80,0:44:02.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,走遍全世界招募了一批船员\N{\rENG}scoured the world for a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:03.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以说\N{\rENG}You might say...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.17,0:44:08.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是当年最出类拔萃的一批人\N{\rENG}...they were the best of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.01,0:44:10.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,最为乐观积极\N{\rENG}the most optimistic,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.84,0:44:13.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们拼尽全力寻找\N{\rENG}searching for a way to carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.50,0:44:15.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,延续文明之火的方式\N{\rENG}the flame of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.76,0:44:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么多船员\N{\rENG}All those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.68,0:44:20.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,7000条生命\N{\rENG}7,000 souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.46,0:44:23.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们是初始船员们的后人\N{\rENG}The descendants of the original inhabitants.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.36,0:44:25.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,到底出了什么差错\N{\rENG}So what went wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.58,0:44:29.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们为什么会从那样一批优秀的船员变成\N{\rENG}How did they go from that to...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.20,0:44:33.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在这个样子\N{\rENG}...whatever it is they became?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.75,0:44:45.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,请进\N{\rENG}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.05,0:44:49.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\rENG}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.29,0:44:50.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是想当面告诉你\N{\rENG}Just wanted to let you know in person,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.76,0:44:52.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,姆'本加医生说维瑞尔舰长\N{\rENG}Dr. M'Benga says that Captain V'Rel is going
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.56,0:44:54.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后会完全康复的\N{\rENG}to make a complete recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.13,0:44:56.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会把法拉格特号拖回船坞\N{\rENG}We'll tow Farragut back to spacedock.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.49,0:44:57.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只需要\N{\rENG}Then you only have
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.86,0:44:59.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,再撑一会儿就好\N{\rENG}to hold the fort down a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.46,0:45:02.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,拖回去一艘没了曲速舱的船\N{\rENG}I'm imagining the look on Admiral April's face
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.30,0:45:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我几乎都能想象到艾普里尔上将的表情了\N{\rENG}when he sees us pull in with no nacelles.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.90,0:45:07.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,他喜欢毕宿五威士忌\N{\rENG}He likes Aldebaran whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.68,0:45:09.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,备好一瓶以备不时之需\N{\rENG}Maybe have a bottle ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.14,0:45:11.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能你会觉得很难受 但你确实做出了正确的决定\N{\rENG}You know, it might not feel like it, but you made the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.48,0:45:13.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们遭到了攻击\N{\rENG}We were under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.28,0:45:16.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你拯救了几百条生命 法拉格特号上的和进取号上的\N{\rENG}You saved hundreds of lives, both here and on Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.82,0:45:18.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,未知船只\N{\rENG}Number of...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.92,0:45:22.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,上的预估伤亡人数是\N{\rENG}estimated human casualties on unknown vessel...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.82,0:45:25.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,七千\N{\rENG}...7,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.72,0:45:30.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以坐下吗\N{\rENG}Well, may I?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.06,0:45:32.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\rENG}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.24,0:45:40.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道 我刚晋升\N{\rENG}You know, when, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.71,0:45:42.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,为大副的时候\N{\rENG}when I got bumped up to first officer,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.94,0:45:44.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得我经常怀疑鲍勃\N{\rENG}I remember second-guessing Bob--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.78,0:45:47.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是艾普里尔上将\N{\rENG}uh, Admiral April-- a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.41,0:45:49.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道他没有为此纠正你的想法吗\N{\rENG}Did he ever straighten you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.18,0:45:50.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.01,0:45:52.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,他给了我一个深刻的教训\N{\rENG}He let me learn a very hard lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.68,0:45:55.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,重大的决定背后需要肩负的责任\N{\rENG}The big decisions-- they seem so simple
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.09,0:45:57.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有在别人身上才看起来轻松\N{\rENG}when someone else has to live with the consequences,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.29,0:45:59.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,但当你坐在舰长的位置上 作出的每一个决定\N{\rENG}but the choices you make in that chair...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.96,0:46:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是你需要肩负的责任\N{\rENG}...they are yours to make...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.44,0:46:06.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,其后果\N{\rENG}...and what comes after...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.68,0:46:09.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,也是你必须承担的\N{\rENG}...that is yours to live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.38,0:46:13.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一些决定会让你悔恨终生\N{\rENG}Some decisions you will regret for the rest of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.34,0:46:14.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你仍然不得不去做\N{\rENG}but you still have to make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.84,0:46:16.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些人都是人类\N{\rENG}They were human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.08,0:46:20.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么我会觉得更难受了\N{\rENG}Why does that make it feel so much worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.76,0:46:21.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能说的只有\N{\rENG}All I can say is...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.05,0:46:25.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,同情你的敌人是工作时的必经之途\N{\rENG}...having empathy for your adversary is part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.45,0:46:27.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我没有\N{\rENG}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.18,0:46:30.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没想过他们会是人类\N{\rENG}I didn't think of them as people...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.32,0:46:32.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,从头到尾\N{\rENG}at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.09,0:46:34.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后一切都无法挽回了\N{\rENG}Until it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.46,0:46:36.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许这正是我们应当反思的\N{\rENG}Well, maybe that's the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.76,0:46:39.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,同情是不看对象的\N{\rENG}Empathy isn't conditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.02,0:46:40.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,有就是有 没有就是没有\N{\rENG}It's either given or it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.28,0:46:43.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们肯定看见了我们的模样\N{\rENG}They... clearly saw us,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.72,0:46:46.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,要么他们没有认出我们 要么他们不在乎\N{\rENG}and either they didn't recognize us or they didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.00,0:46:47.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论过去两百年\N{\rENG}Whatever journey they had been through
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.36,0:46:48.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生了什么 他们已经不是当初的那批船员了\N{\rENG}the last 200 years, it broke them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.80,0:46:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们离开地球的时候\N{\rENG}When they left Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.92,0:46:54.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,是全人类中最优秀的\N{\rENG}...they were the best humanity had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.78,0:46:57.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们过去并不是怪物\N{\rENG}They weren't monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.02,0:47:01.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在同样的情况下也会变成那样吗\N{\rENG}Is that what we would become in the same circumstances?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.52,0:47:03.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们不会的\N{\rENG}I'd like to believe we wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.66,0:47:04.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\rENG}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.46,0:47:06.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我们对他们怀有同情\N{\rENG}Because of how you're feeling right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.11,0:47:07.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为下一次你作为舰长下达指令的时候\N{\rENG}Because the next time you're in that chair,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.36,0:47:09.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会想起我们与我们的敌人\N{\rENG}you will remember we are often not that different
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.29,0:47:11.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,并没有那么不同\N{\rENG}from our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.19,0:47:15.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,这种认识\N{\rENG}And that knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.43,0:47:17.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,从现在起\N{\rENG}from this moment on,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.00,0:47:19.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,会永远指引着你\N{\rENG}will continue to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.51,0:47:31.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安 柯克舰长\N{\rENG}Good night, Captain Kirk.
